{"seq":328,"elapsed_ms":4796,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"We need answer only DUT code between [BEGIN] and [DONE]. Need implement TopModule counter 0..999 with period 1000 cycles. clk, reset, q 10 bits. active high synchronous reset to 0. On posedge clk if reset q <= 0; else if q == 999 q <=0; else q <= q + 1. Use SystemVerilog. Single module.\n\nNeed be careful width. 10 bits can hold 999. q output logic [9:0]. Return complete DUT. No explanation. Exactly format.\n\nPotential issue: reset synchronous active high. Good.\n\nCould use `always_ff @(posedge clk)`. If reset then q <= 10'd0. else if (q == 10'd999) q <= 10'd0; else q <= q + 10'd1;\n\nNeed include module definition. Maybe `module TopModule (input logic clk, input logic reset, output logic [9:0] q);`.\n\nLet's output. "}}}
{"seq":329,"elapsed_ms":4796,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"[BEGIN]\nmodule TopModule (\n    input  logic       clk,\n    input  logic       reset,\n    output logic [9:0] q\n);\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset) begin\n            q <= 10'd0;\n        end else if (q == 10'd999) begin\n            q <= 10'd0;\n        end else begin\n            q <= q + 10'd1;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n[DONE]"}}}
